<title>UK: German inland gas oil steady.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7230)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.60/33.00     18.92/19.15   32.40/32.90</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.60/33.00     18.92/19.15   32.40/32.90</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    32.70/33.10     18.98/19.21   32.60/33.00</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.30/33.70     19.32/19.55   33.40/33.70</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.60/34.00     19.50/19.73   33.70/34.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.80/35.20     20.20/20.43   34.90/35.23</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were little changed on Wednesday in line with stable Rotterdam barge and international futures markets. Traders reported moderate buying interest.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
